Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《兄弟烙印》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次成为胜者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.60,0:02:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius门下尚且残存有人 这真是奇迹啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a marvel good solonius has any men left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次竞技终极勇士 必是这个色雷斯人不成？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must the thracian appear in every primus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,堂堂Batiatus家族 难道没有另一角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the house of not deem another gladiator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.46,0:02:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以技惊四座吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worthy of spectacle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,除却此人 他们也没什么能人斗士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have no one else of note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之后 Crixus亦将重铸辉煌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus will return to glory, presently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿如您所说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不二人选啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A welcome addition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个色雷斯人真令人心生厌倦 总是他一人取胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grow tried of this thracian and his victories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件重要之事或许可以稍减枯燥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps something of note to erase the tedium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将在明天的拍卖会上购进一批新的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I purchase a fresh batch of slaves at auction tomorrow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将他们训练成角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be trained as gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,若您能赏光受入仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would be honored if you would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将倍感荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace us at the unveiling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备买什么样的野人啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of beasts shall you procure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最剽悍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the most ferocious, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切随您心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be displayed for your pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一场拍卖即将开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our next auction is about to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们财运亨通啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune favors us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑点好的 我们的钱足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fine selection, enough coin to take our pick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.83,0:03:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的对手来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your competitor approaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius 真让我喜不自胜啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius, my heart brims with joy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就盼着您来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had hoped to see you here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,多买些新人 好让斯巴达克斯屠戮啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buying new men for spartacus to slaughter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus 你现在也侍财倨傲 鸡犬升天了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus, now purse-proud and so potent with charm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事变幻无常啊 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How quickly fortuna shifts her blessings. Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爱侄Ovidius可没机会知晓实情了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fact that beloved ovidius was unexpectedly made aware.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,言之有理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被谋杀实属悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}His murder was a deep tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会知道暴行的始作俑者了 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}One can never know who is plotting violence, can one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他们还会再犯下罪行呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or when they may commit the act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,慷慨的卡普亚市民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good citizens of capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍卖会开始了 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The auction begins, dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入正题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To business, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:03:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条血肉身躯绝对是上乘绝品…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold the finest offering of flesh and bone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.73,0:04:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个高卢人Segovax要价比较高\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gaul segovax will demand expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许您还可以考虑这对日耳曼兄弟 Duro和Agron\N{\fnArial\fs30}And perhaps the german brothers, duro and agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人选吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,均不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of little worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先向您推荐 这位享有堂堂声誉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us begin with a celtic gaul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢凯尔特人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of imposing virtues!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为您推荐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看Segovax\N{\fnArial\fs30}Segovax, an imposing gaul, is pulled forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,赤身就是战袍！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skin, his armor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手就是兵器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands, his steel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁欲领取此人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would claim such a man?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬请出价！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,五迪纳币！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five denarii!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊贵的Vibius出价五迪纳币！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five denari from good vibius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,十迪纳币！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten denarii!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.30,0:04:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十五迪纳币！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-five denarii!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都懒得出价了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grow tired of bidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百迪纳币！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred denarii!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全买下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the entire lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,归Batiatus了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}To batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的救世主！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Savior of capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人 无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}With respect dominus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,您开出的价位 已远远超出了他们实际所值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your coin far exceeds their value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.76,0:05:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他娘的价值！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck value!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么能比 看到这个狗杂碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}None can be placed on seeing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜倒在我脚下 更让人愉悦的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That cock eater's pride ground beneath my heel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius 考虑一下这些贱女吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius, consider the whores!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.53,0:05:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把女人派往竞技场角斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you will have better fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准就能时来运转啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting women in the arena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没能满足你吗 主人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I not pleased you, domina?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那阳物依旧萎靡啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your cock stand dry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕难以力撑挺入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear you have not quaked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的伤口尚未完全愈合\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wounds have yet to fully heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会完全恢复 重振雄风的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well you will recover and all will be as it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人从市场回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus returns from the market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have me do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.03,0:06:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我拒绝了 主人她一定会心生疑虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I refuse, domina will grow suspicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力表现出自己很虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I perform as weakly as I can, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望她能对我失去性致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoping she will lose interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有生你的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not angry with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it difficult{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你和主人共享欢愉 而我们却没有这样的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you and domina share what we have not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有那么一阵不快\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心为你专属\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alone occupy my thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了 你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead, you're dead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下你们死定了 全部死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're dead, you're all dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脚下踩着的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is beneath your feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.33,0:08:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,神圣的土地 Doctore！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacred ground, doctore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,被血泪所浸染的战场！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watered with tears of blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的眼泪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些可悲的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pathetic lives, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过锻炼而有了价值…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forged into something of worth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌那说话的蠢蛋5迪纳币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five denarii on the fool who spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听从 学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. Learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 可以活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And perhaps, live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}As gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 留心你们的主人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, attend your master!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将被保佑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been blessed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each and every one of you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,将在这里找到自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find yourselves here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.53,0:08:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在Quintus Lentulus的训练场里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the ludus of quintus lentulus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里全共和国最优秀的角斗士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purveyor of the finest in all of the republic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在以后的艰苦岁月里 证明你们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove yourselves, in the hard days to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明你们不只是个普通的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove yourselves more than a common slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是个简单的男人 败 即亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than a man. Fail, and die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丈夫说话像我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband speaks as my father would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在议院时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个好演说家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's quite the orator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有阿波罗的口才啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tongue of apollo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.90,0:09:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功 就能骄傲地立于我的战神们之中！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Succeed, and stand proud among my titans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus，batiatus，batiatus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus, batiatus, batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗士从不畏惧死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gladiator does not fear death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拥抱它\N{\fnArial\fs30}He embraces it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱抚着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caresses it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,干它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucks it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得新人们怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What make you of the new men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可真壮观啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are spectacles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现我已深深沉迷于这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find myself growing quite fond of this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,肮脏的角斗士交易之中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sordid business of gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should consider purchasing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你自己也买一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,买角斗士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gladiator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:09:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑一个新人 就是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose a recruit, and he is yours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.73,0:10:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 象征性地给一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a nominal fee, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟需要金钱开销\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such funds to cover the expense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的生活和训练费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of his upkeep and his training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技场里的每一次胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every victory in the arena, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是对女主人的致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is an honor to his domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该选哪一个好呢？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who should I choose?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让我来帮您挑选一个吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I offer a suggestion to aid your dilemma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doctore啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尊敬的客人希望 检视一下新人们的品质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our honored guest wishes to access the recruits' virtues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.16,0:10:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把衣服脱了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove your cloths!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要改一下我的赌注了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to alter my bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.30,0:11:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,全压在那个阳物最大的人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything on the one with the horse cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边的那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one on the left…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Segovax 高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Segovax, gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定受到了生殖之神的眷顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has truly been blessed by the god priapus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,选得不错啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fine specimen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要庆祝庆祝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must celebrate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,取些酒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}See to the wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁可以娶到这么好的妻子啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has a man ever had such a wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还深爱着她的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She but loves her husband, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.83,0:11:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他步步高升\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would see him elevated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.60,0:11:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于我自己的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gladiator of my own, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Crixus来自同一个地方！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mined from the same lands as crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友们知道了 肯定会为之尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The envy of my friends shall spread like locusts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,羡慕死我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their hearts devoured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会这么嫉妒你啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would you torture so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望 可别是我认识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one of my acquaintance, I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doubtful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Caecila Aemilia啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caecila, aemilia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:12:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia 是Marcus Crassus的表亲吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia, cousin to marcus crassus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,全罗马城最富有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wealthiest man in rome, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他是这么讲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to him, at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.73,0:12:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia 非常享受这些比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia, in particular enjoys the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.03,0:12:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,更喜欢竞技场中如野兽般的勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}More so the beasts who do battle in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该私下里发个邀请函\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must make invitation for private{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的Segovax介绍给她们认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Introduction to your man segovax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她们来这边玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here at the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 这些都是正统的罗马女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, these are proper roman women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们只和同地位的家族成员来往\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only mingle with families of equal standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 也许这样就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, perhaps it's for the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你勇士的肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing your man in the flesh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会让她们更加嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would only inflame their envy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去安排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will arrange it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会来帮你做做头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I shall even help you with your hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要让你在这样高层的聚会中 看起来很适宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must make you look suitable for such elevated company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在太阳下烘烤的废物们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit baking in the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像昨天 我们还和他们一样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems only yesterday we were of a similar position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是时过境迁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much has changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已成为该死的卡普亚战神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You became the fucking champion of capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.56,0:13:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的传奇将万古流芳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your myth to echo for a thousand years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而我… - 成为了我的挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I… - Became a good friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro 骰子喊你呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The die call your name!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And varro answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要赌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You continue to gamble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,花点钱也好打发时间啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few coins to pass the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的急什么 角斗士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking wait until gladiators{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,都还没填饱肚子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have filled their bellies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须忍受痛苦和折磨 才能成为角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must embrace pain and suffering to become gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就该如此做\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how it is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮不到你管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.39,0:13:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 多宽厚仁慈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus… the kind and gentle one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要误解我的意思 Crixus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not mistake me, crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是懒得理这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give no shit about these men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.36,0:14:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再是卡普亚的战神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are no longer the champion of capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里你不再独大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not take lead here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是手下而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,手下就要一直紧随你左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man who follows is forever at your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才称得上战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to consider champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking gauls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,死也要做个饱死鬼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men should not die with empty stomachs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rhaskos啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhaskos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 已到月末了 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, end of the month already, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你读不懂日历算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the calendar you cannot read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.33,0:15:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢的钱总计三个半迪纳币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your winnings amount to three and a half denarii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要钱呢 还是要爽一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preserve coin, or indulge yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么时候要钱不要女人了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do I ever take coin over gash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我期望她屁股最好擦干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect her ass to be returned free of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur 你错过我的房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur, you pass my cell by mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钱呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my coin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,错是你自己种下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mistake is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想打的话 你就没资格享受金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not fight, you are entitled to neither coin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早会传到主人耳朵里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dominus shall hear about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 名单正是他写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh his very hand set the names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许下个月 你就会发现自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps next month you should find yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,又会回到他们之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again among them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是你的伤先好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should your wounds ever heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro, a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几次胜利赢了不少钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your victories amass much coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一如既往地 把钱交给你妻子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I see it transferred to your wife as usual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.63,0:16:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想花点零头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you prefer a small portion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来缓解一下压力呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Applied towards more pressing concerns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那矮子就是他妈的卡普亚战神吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tiny man is the fucking champion of capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的罗马人把他的传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking romans swell his legend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.23,0:17:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼓吹成自己的优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}To their advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们轻易就能打败他 Agron\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could easily best the man, agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.03,0:17:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯打败了死亡之影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus defeated theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他胜利的荣耀闪烁苍穹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the skies wept to honor of his victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个的挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of you would present challenge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.03,0:17:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Equal to piss and shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我说的很有趣吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find my words amusing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your words, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说这些的那傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stupid fuck that speaks them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,才真他妈搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very fucking amusing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯是很好的例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus is a man to be held as an example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.83,0:17:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个奴隶点燃了竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slave ignites the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 这把火会让他挣破枷锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day the flames shall set him free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经见证过同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've witnessed such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们欢呼怒嚎 要求角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The roar of the crowd, demanding a gladiator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因其在竞技场的表现 而获取自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be granted freedom for his showing in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.03,0:17:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连和他称兄道弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't even earned the mark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈都不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the fucking brotherhood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还叫嚣会自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you cluck about freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Segovax说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Segovax is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯给我们指明了道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus shows us the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要像他一样训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will train as he trains, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,铭记每一次冲击与抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every thrust and counter committed to memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有一天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也将成为竞技场的传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I too will become legend in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raaa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,治好他的伤还要点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wounds need yet more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,两到四周吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fortnight or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能六周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊… 该死的神啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh…Jupiter's cock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,药剂师没在 要是有那些草药的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}His recovery may be aided by certain herbs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的伤会好得更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent the apothecary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人 我已经很久没摸过我的剑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus, I've been without sword for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:18:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我继续训练吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me resume training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去看看 需要哪些药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will see all on the list procured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听医师的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heed medicus' warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的剑很快就会回到手中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sword will return to your hand soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼陀罗草… 莨菪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mandragora… Henbane…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,碱液… 曼陀罗花…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lye… Thorn apple…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁杉… 颠茄… 还要半打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hemlock… Belladonna… Half a dozen more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大的订单啊 得花多少钱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Substantial lists, requiring substantial coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我拿最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Procure the highest quality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,药用得好 就能有好治疗效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}A justified expense, should remedy result.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望上天看到他妈的这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods see it fucking so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经很多天没有起色了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many days pass without progress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doctore被Theokoles砍伤的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When doctore suffered wounds from theokoles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没见他们要求相同的治疗时间啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they require equal time in the healing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当的少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considerably less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许只是徒劳罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be a blessing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,白费功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hidden among such a curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就拿Crixus的真实情况来说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk of crixus' true condition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然也还是逃不过这关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely has not escaped beyond these walls. Yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your meaning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.90,0:19:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看怎么能冠冕堂皇地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inquiries for his purchase could be made{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a delicate fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.66,0:19:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我此去市场可以达成两个目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My visit to the market could serve dual purposes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想打歪主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove the thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止所有 有关卖掉Crixus的谈论\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be no talk of selling crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人 我只是为以后着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only fear for the future, dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远生活在斯巴达克斯的阴影之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that does not see spartacus erased from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.73,0:20:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别他妈跟我绕圈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straighten your fucking tongue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明白点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And speak plainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 我亲眼目睹 Crixus对斯巴达克斯的仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday I witnessed the hatred cultivates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.53,0:20:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经到了无以复加的地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards spartacus, grow beyond measure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,按他的火爆脾气来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}If in his mad passion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 会以身犯险…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus, were to make attempt on his life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤身挑战斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solicit numbers from sextus, alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.13,0:20:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus恢复延迟的流言 绝不能传开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word of crixus' stunted recovery must not to spread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望能 好好挖掘他的现有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish only to discover his current value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把Crixus卖了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would sell crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.23,0:20:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要想尽一切办法敛财\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would explore all avenues of reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您真要这样 钱财会源源不断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which has flown if you consider such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus会重新战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus will fight again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还会像以前一样所向披靡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But will he ever be the man he was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他点时间治伤 Quintus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him time to heal, quintus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和常人无异 受伤了也会流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bleeds when pierced, as does any man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.73,0:20:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众可不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowds do not see a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.03,0:20:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他当成神 我们亦如此尊待他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see him a god, and we present him as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.73,0:20:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦神话破灭 他的价值也不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should that myth evaporate, so goes his worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们会在其他方面找到价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll find worth in another role.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的知识肯定可以给下面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well surely his knowledge would aid instruction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.26,0:20:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些指导的啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the lower men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经有了个Doctore\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already have a doctore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在任何竞技场 他都是最出色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The finest in any ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他可以和你并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could work beside you, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus要的不是钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus has no head for numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙场才是他的唯一目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sword is his only purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这个家的一员 Quintus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's part of the family, quintus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是个他妈的奴隶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a fucking slave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.30,0:21:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家房子 这个家 都只是个交易 Lucretia\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house, this family, is a business, lucretia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.36,0:21:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖掉像Crixus这般的角斗士 确实很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much regret results from selling a gladiator like crixus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要时机成熟 他们都他妈地会被卖掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the time arrives, and it fucking will for them all, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是没办法的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a necessity that must be swallowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没做最后的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No decision has yet to be made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许还能证明自己能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may still prove himself fit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,多操心下Ilithyia和她的朋友们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn your mind towards and her friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢得了她们的青睐 这个家族才会更加荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Win their favor, and see this family rise ever higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但前冲的时候 你的盾掉下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you lower your shield when you thrust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.53,0:21:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会把你从肩部到脖子全部暴露出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It leaves you open from shoulder to neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:21:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.83,0:22:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doctore无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctore's gaze misses nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸把危机变成了必然\N{\fnArial\fs30}A risk made necessary by unfortunate events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.96,0:22:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has something happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am ever safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但主人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But dominus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他考虑 把你卖给别的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He considers selling you to another master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.50,0:22:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.66,0:22:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经派Ashur去市场买草药…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur has been sent to market for herb…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.43,0:22:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时也是去询问Vibius对你有没有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to question vibius on his interest towards you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.83,0:22:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vibius？Lanista那狗杂种！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibius? Lanista of shits and mongrels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.93,0:22:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在竞技场所赢得的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glory I have earned this ludus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.53,0:22:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈地竟然换来了这些！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fucking reward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 你必须向主人证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus, you must prove to dominus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.53,0:22:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时代还没有过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That your time has not passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为角斗士踏上战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}To step onto the sand as a gladiator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.26,0:23:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是奴隶无比期盼的最高荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the highest position a slave can pray for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.56,0:23:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢得兄弟之谊的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earn the mark of the brotherhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.53,0:23:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这一击还真重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You strike a solid blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.70,0:23:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是对个没怎么训练的傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against an ill-trained fool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.86,0:23:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他玷污了高卢人的名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who taints the name of gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许是个傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may be a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他能够训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is one who is fit to train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.86,0:23:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.33,0:23:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我没痊愈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doubt that I am fully healed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 我将会证明你的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coz I will show you otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doctore Crixus自称恢复了健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctore, crixus offers a demonstration, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.66,0:23:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望重回训练！\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the benefit of the recruits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.03,0:23:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该同意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I indulge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.23,0:23:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信自己已准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes himself ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.46,0:23:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Segovax 你的剑和盾给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Segovax, your sword and shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.76,0:24:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,列队！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.53,0:24:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 看看谁才是战神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show then whose champion, crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.80,0:24:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.46,0:24:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进攻毫无章法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He attacks boldly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.56,0:24:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只求速战速决\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hasten victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.33,0:24:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,与正常训练刚好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Counter to proper training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.70,0:25:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败不仅仅源自手中的剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defeat is delivered not only by the sword, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.13,0:25:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样来自于观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}But also the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.06,0:25:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跌落神坛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall from their grace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.86,0:25:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你再也得不回以前的荣耀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you may never rise to former glories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的角斗士 要学会忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}A true gladiator is taught to embrace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.36,0:25:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤痛与磨难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain and suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.70,0:25:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗 直到生命的最后一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}To fight until life flees from his worthless body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.03,0:26:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸取他的教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn from this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.00,0:26:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则殊途同归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or share his fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.00,0:26:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.70,0:26:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.16,0:26:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rhaskos Hamilcar 出列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhaskos, hamilcar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他去看医师\N{\fnArial\fs30}See him to the medicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.56,0:26:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错的价格 善良的Vibius\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fine offer, good vibius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.86,0:26:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迫不及待地想要转达给我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall hasten to present it to my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.23,0:26:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}A moment, slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.20,0:27:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然背着Batiatus经常光顾市场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You frequent the market absent batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.26,0:27:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以他的名义来进行重要交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I conduct important business on his behalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.20,0:27:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关前卡普亚战神的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regarding the former champion of capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.63,0:27:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会谈论此类交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I discuss no business of the like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.16,0:27:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你的话 我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would, if found in your position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.50,0:27:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus只是名义上的战神而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus is champion in name only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.40,0:27:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过就是人为刀俎 他为鱼肉罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is but limbs, dangling from a skewered trunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.96,0:27:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他当给像Vibius这样讨人厌的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your master would be well served{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.20,0:27:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你主人算盘打得不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pawning him off on a toad like vibius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.13,0:27:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你替我主人的考虑已经收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your concern for my master is well received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为他考虑 而是为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My concern is not for him, but about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.43,0:27:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are your ears receptive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.16,0:27:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无权阻止一个自由人发表言论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot stop a free man from speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.70,0:27:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus认为我冒犯了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were batiatus, were to seek reprisal for offenses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.93,0:27:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就向我报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes I have made, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望事先能得到警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would wish warning in advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.83,0:27:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.43,0:28:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会为你作恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not your villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.20,0:28:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,找其他奴隶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seek another slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.83,0:28:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠诚如果没有适当的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyalty can become a crushing weight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.03,0:28:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,终会把人压扁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not braced by proper support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.83,0:28:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你感觉到重压之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your back begins to break, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会发现我宽广的臂膀在迎接着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find my shoulders broad and welcoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.10,0:28:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的自不量力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You overreach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.46,0:28:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成了现在的恶果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here is the result.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.73,0:28:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我说得跟个新人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not address me as you would a recruit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.23,0:28:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别表现成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do not act like one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.96,0:28:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,从伟大的斯巴达克斯 送雨的使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words of import from the mighty spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.23,0:28:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴里说出的东西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringer of rain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.10,0:28:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠灭死亡之影的勇士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slayer of theokoles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.93,0:28:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是你独自和他作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if you stood against him on your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.26,0:28:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我的相助 你就一无所有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without my aid, you would have nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连你现在的痛苦生活也会失去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even your miserable life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.23,0:28:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.30,0:29:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我站在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here I stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.23,0:29:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却倒在了那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there you sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.23,0:29:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不明白怎么做战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know shit about being champion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不明白什么是真正的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of being a true brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.56,0:29:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在那儿自以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are only playing at your own part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.40,0:29:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但总有一天游戏会落幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day the game will end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.63,0:29:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都难逃一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death comes to us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.93,0:29:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,再激怒我 你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press me again, and you shall find yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.16,0:29:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢各位今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for joining us this evening, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.13,0:29:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,莅临Batiatus家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the house of batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.60,0:29:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们聊得真是投机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed has spoken so very highly of you that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.70,0:29:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像是遇到了老友一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feels if I'm with old friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.73,0:29:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这可真是失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's a disadvantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.66,0:29:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia从没说过她与\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia neglected to mention she was acquainted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.16,0:29:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus的妻子相交甚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the wife of good batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.46,0:29:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定有提过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure I must have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.20,0:29:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不说还真没发现 她真够贱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is quite the bitch, if you have not noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.83,0:30:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们大家都喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why we love her so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.70,0:30:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也越来越爱她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grow rather fond of her myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.63,0:30:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我得喝杯酒 润润舌尖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, I could use a cup of wine to wet the tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.86,0:30:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,您可以开怀大饮 喝到醉倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be drowning, and gurgle the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.96,0:30:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.26,0:30:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这是Sestian酒么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Is this sestian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.03,0:30:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是费勒年葡萄酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falernian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.30,0:30:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 她真费心啊 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, she is trying hard, is she not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.90,0:30:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为我跟她说过 你们对我有多重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only because I have told her how important you are to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.53,0:30:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们都很友爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we all love each other{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.90,0:30:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢在新月下狂欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have orgies under the new moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.43,0:30:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在跟我们讲讲故事吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now tell us stories!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.33,0:30:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 跟我们讲讲这个可怕的地方！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, tell us everything about this horrid place!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.56,0:30:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是指下面的训练场\N{\fnArial\fs30}She means the ludus below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.70,0:30:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还用你解说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need an interpreter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.36,0:30:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.36,0:30:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 听她说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do be quiet, let her speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.46,0:30:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能活在这群野兽之中？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you live among such beasts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.90,0:30:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的丈夫驯服了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband sees them well tamed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.10,0:30:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不完全吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray not fully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.23,0:30:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还保存了些本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some instinct remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.10,0:30:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们可以在角斗场释放兽性\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that they may yet unleash their savagery in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.56,0:30:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是住这里 会抓狂的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would go insane here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.96,0:30:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这山顶上 还被一群野兽所包围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrounded by all these animals, high atop this mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不想住到城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you not prefer to live in the city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.23,0:30:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,和真正的人们呆在一起么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrounded by real people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.50,0:30:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这里很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find that we are perfectly located.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.50,0:31:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要走出阳台\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need only step out onto my balcony{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.30,0:31:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的卡普亚人就会臣服于我的脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of capua kneels at my feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.96,0:31:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well stated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.30,0:31:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不闷吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But are you not bored?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.90,0:31:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这上面 孤孤单单的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here, all alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.33,0:31:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了奴隶和野兽外 一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but slaves and beasts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.96,0:31:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至也没有孩子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even children to occupy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.73,0:31:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,闷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boredom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.60,0:31:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多好玩的事情 才不会呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible with so many distractions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.83,0:31:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stay quite occupied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.70,0:31:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都有新的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each day brings with it opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.96,0:31:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 昨天就有6个新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, in fact, six new recruits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.06,0:31:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,投入了训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Began their training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.90,0:31:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个还是Ilithyia买下的 为她而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of whom fights under ilithyia's patronage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.30,0:31:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.73,0:31:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Claudius准许你这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claudius gave you approval?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.43,0:31:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.63,0:31:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一点钱 我自己的补贴就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few coins, parceled from my allowance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.06,0:31:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道了会杀死你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will kill you when he finds out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.10,0:31:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就会杀掉第一个告密的人 Caecilia！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will kill the first who tells, caecilia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.03,0:31:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你有个专属的角斗士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, a gladiator of your own!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.80,0:31:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能看看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.60,0:31:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他现在还不是角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course, he's not yet a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.20,0:31:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须通过最后测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must pass the final test{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.30,0:32:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能加入Batiatus的角斗士队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he earns the mark of batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.66,0:32:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 所以他现在只是个奴隶咯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. So he is only a slave, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.70,0:32:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 只是暂时的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for the time being but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.53,0:32:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更想看看真正的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would lay eyes upon a real gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.20,0:32:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.10,0:32:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,战神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A champion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.10,0:32:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把斯巴达克斯带上来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring spartacus up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.03,0:32:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 噢 是啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, oh yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.43,0:32:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.93,0:32:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把战神带上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.66,0:32:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他为我们的狂欢助兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us all revel in his psence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.26,0:32:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.80,0:32:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我训练时的相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your aid in my training today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.63,0:32:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想听听你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be eager to hear any advice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.83,0:32:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我日后的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}To further my cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.33,0:32:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.26,0:33:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样在竞技场上获得荣耀 和自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victories in the arena, and freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.40,0:33:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛弃自由的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forsake any thoughts of freedom, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.36,0:33:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,摒弃你曾有的这高墙之外的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the life you once had beyond these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.30,0:33:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受命运…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accept your fate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.50,0:33:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是被曾经一切 一去不复返的恐惧击倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or be destroyed by specters of a past never to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.06,0:33:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 主人传唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, you are summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.50,0:33:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他跟个战神一样屹立 时刻准备战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, he stands as mars, ready for war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.46,0:33:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,传言是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there truth to the legends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.83,0:33:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗士们和诸神血脉相连？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gladiators share the blood of the gods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.53,0:33:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最有可能的 应该是强大的Crixus\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mighty crixus, most certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.93,0:33:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而今 有个男人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there was a man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.40,0:33:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正被神明赐福！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly blessed by the gods!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.43,0:33:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他何时能重返竞技场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will we see him in the arena again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.90,0:33:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.00,0:33:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟是什么 斯巴达克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of you, spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.30,0:33:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是神灵赐予我们的使者吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a blessing to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.46,0:33:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对某些人来说 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.33,0:34:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对其他人 却是诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}To others, a curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他这般的双面人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A duality of his kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.46,0:34:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然是披戴荣光的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admired as a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.00,0:34:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,却也是一名卑贱的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet despised as a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.43,0:34:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可远胜一名普通奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is much more than a common slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.53,0:34:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感知 他肉体散发出的力量…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can feel it radiating from his flesh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.33,0:34:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾听过一个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard tale of a champion's blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.70,0:34:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,战神之血 蕴含着惊人的滋补能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possessing many restorative powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.06,0:34:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说 在一杯酒中 掺入几滴冠军之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few drops in a glass of wine is said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.33,0:34:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能令一个男人 坚挺数日之久！\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make a man hard for days!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.16,0:34:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such are the legends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.53,0:34:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想亲身验证这传说 请问我可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I would test them for myself, if I could?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.40,0:34:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.83,0:34:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会派信使 送去一小瓶血液…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send a messenger with a vial…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.90,0:34:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.10,0:34:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能获此荣耀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I have the honor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.56,0:34:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心 伤口别切太深\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care not to cut too deeply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.13,0:34:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说刻是要一名死去角斗士的血液啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legend does call for the blood of a dead gladiator, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.10,0:34:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.26,0:34:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我们无需挂心这等小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But such details should not concern us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:35:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 很快就要丧命…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus will die soon enough…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.73,0:35:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在观众的吼叫中死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the roar of the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.40,0:35:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不相信 他会命丧竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not believe he will ever fall in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.86,0:35:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是角斗士中的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a god among men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.70,0:35:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无非是条色雷斯狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's nothing but a thracian dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.73,0:35:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的叛变 令罗马蒙羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}His treachery dishonored rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.66,0:35:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的丈夫 令罗马蒙羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is your husband who bears the dishonor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.30,0:35:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.53,0:35:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抛弃手无寸铁的妇孺\N{\fnArial\fs30}He abandoned defenseless women and children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.43,0:35:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷他们于被强暴和杀戮的绝境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left to be raped and murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.00,0:35:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.60,0:35:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是出言不逊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a bold tongue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.70,0:35:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.03,0:35:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他是我的奴隶 我定要将他钉在十字架上处死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were he my slave, I would have him crucified!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.83,0:35:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.10,0:35:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为口吐真言么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.93,0:35:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都听过关于你丈夫的流言\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all heard the rumors about your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.86,0:35:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天色已晚 还有人等着我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hour grows late, and I'm expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.73,0:35:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你分享 如此趣味盎然的一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for a most interesting evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.73,0:35:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这样的夜晚 能很快重现\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that begs a repeat soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.10,0:36:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.86,0:36:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,无须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}None required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.30,0:36:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上就会知道 身份显赫的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will soon learn that women of note{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.06,0:36:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是多么渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a rabid taste{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.73,0:36:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到朋友们尴尬窘迫的场面\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the embarrassment of their friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.96,0:36:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不希望 我的朋友被人如此欺辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I would not see mine treated so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.23,0:36:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我离开前 我能和Segovax说几句话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I have words with segovax, before I take my leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.30,0:36:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能为他往后的日子 带来好运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to bid my man good fortune in the days to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.13,0:36:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.70,0:36:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 我的运气又回来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, my fortune returns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.60,0:36:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.86,0:36:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正赢着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm of a winning mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.00,0:36:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省你那归劝的说辞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your words of caution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.23,0:36:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并非来劝说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here for words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.06,0:36:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来赌博的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for dice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.83,0:36:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 来赌博？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and dice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.36,0:36:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚情绪不佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am of a mood tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.90,0:36:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,心烦意乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have distraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.83,0:36:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是带了钱来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.56,0:37:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 老规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.96,0:37:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如果需要提示 自然会问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I need instruction, I shall ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.66,0:37:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要单独呆一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.93,0:37:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我是谁吗 奴隶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am, slave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.33,0:37:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.23,0:37:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.00,0:37:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我付钱供你训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}My coin pays for your training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.50,0:37:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.66,0:37:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,和食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.16,0:37:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你呼吸的每一口空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very air you breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.33,0:37:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,若能幸存 烙上印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survive to receive the mark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.06,0:37:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将成为我的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will become my gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.13,0:38:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我培养的战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}My champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.90,0:38:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.10,0:38:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,取悦于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.56,0:38:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将获得丰厚的奖赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rewards will be substantial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.93,0:38:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,美酒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.30,0:38:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.43,0:38:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是 自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even freedom, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.63,0:38:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很渴望吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You desire such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.33,0:38:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴望自由？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.30,0:38:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.70,0:38:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有所渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something I desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.76,0:38:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,若能满足我的渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}See it attended to, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.03,0:38:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自可获得自由…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your freedom will be secured…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.86,0:38:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真不该召唤斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should never have been summoned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.30,0:38:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没得选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had little choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.06,0:38:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该把他和Ilithyia分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia, and the man should be kept separate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.86,0:38:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他们在一起 简直是自找麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throwing them together invites calamity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.16,0:38:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有风险 但也有赚头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The risk bore fruit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.53,0:38:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lincinia 表明会再次拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lincinia, intimates another visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.76,0:39:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对斯巴达克斯有意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus her purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.13,0:39:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,毋庸置疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undoubtedly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.43,0:39:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们得做些调整\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we shall accommodate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.26,0:39:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的表亲Crassus掌控着这片天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her cousin good crassus owns the fucking heavens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.26,0:39:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使他当前 并未获得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if he is not currently favored by{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.80,0:39:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,议院盟友的拥戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}His fellows in the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.76,0:39:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的努力 会让我们站得更高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your efforts raise us ever higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.23,0:39:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那边如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do yours fare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.16,0:39:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人对Crixus报价吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you received offers for crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.20,0:39:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天将会见Vibius\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meet vibius tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.26,0:39:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么是Vibius？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.93,0:39:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的训练场在大马士革呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}His ludus is in damascus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.56,0:39:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus在小地方才能更好的过活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus will fare better in the smaller venues, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.16,0:39:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until he is healed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.50,0:39:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 那就明天 如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tomorrow, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.30,0:39:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的荣耀已渐渐远去\N{\fnArial\fs30}His glory fades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.36,0:39:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会让这荣耀 在我的掌中熄灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have it extinguish beneath our roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,大马士革吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damascus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.63,0:39:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人明天要去面谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus meets with tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.00,0:39:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还从未去过大马士革呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen damascus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.03,0:39:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会喜欢那里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I'll like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.40,0:40:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.53,0:40:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,此事已成定局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The decision is made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,连女主人都不再信任我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even domina doubts me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.36,0:40:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从她的眼中就能看出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it in her eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.46,0:40:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就想办法说服她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then convince her otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.10,0:40:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的话无足轻重\N{\fnArial\fs30}My words carry no weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.53,0:40:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不对主人进言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not speak of words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.80,0:40:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我劝服主人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have me do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.16,0:40:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.53,0:41:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你输给我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coin you lost to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.53,0:41:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了就是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes it yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.86,0:41:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.86,0:41:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前也曾赌博\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have thrown dice before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.60,0:41:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,数年前 我已金盆洗手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned from such things years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.30,0:41:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.00,0:41:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我相比 你真是个好男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a better man than I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.86,0:41:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了你为何沦陷于此 Varro\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not forget why you are here, varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.86,0:41:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿开你的手 - 你让家人蒙羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remove your hand. - You dishonor your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.13,0:41:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给你老婆丢脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dishonor your own wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.46,0:41:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老婆是个荡妇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife is a whore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.13,0:41:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怀上了别人的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She carries another man's child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.13,0:41:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did this come to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.66,0:41:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个朋友 集市上认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend, from the marketplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.43,0:41:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她声称是被逼 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She claims he forced his way onto her, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.56,0:41:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将过错归咎于她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you find fault with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.60,0:41:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did not fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.73,0:41:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是你为了偿债而离家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had you not left to pay your debts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.50,0:42:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又何至于糟蹋自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would not have had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.16,0:42:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着 Varro\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives, varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.36,0:42:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.80,0:42:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍可以拥她入怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may yet hold her in your arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.16,0:42:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个宽厚的男人 该懂得珍惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thought a decent man would cherish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.63,0:42:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫正在集市上 商谈你的价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband is at market on business concerning you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.36,0:42:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信你的荣誉 已渐渐远去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes your day may have passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.13,0:42:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.93,0:42:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷他是错误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray he is mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.43,0:42:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所祈祷的神明呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your gods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.86,0:43:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有回应你的祷告吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they answer your prayers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.20,0:43:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们沉默无言\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're silent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.76,0:43:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我们力破苍天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let us crack open the heavens…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.13,0:43:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,获得他们的关注…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And gain their attention…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.73,0:43:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那些对我荣耀不再的疑云…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove any doubt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.06,0:43:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟消云散…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That my day has passed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.06,0:43:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.70,0:43:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.70,0:43:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.46,0:43:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来… 很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seemed… Pleased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.90,0:43:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Naevia啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.06,0:43:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已尽心尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did what you had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.80,0:43:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,按我的吩咐行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I asked of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.36,0:44:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人已经在集市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus is already at market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.30,0:44:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Vibius商谈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking with vibius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.20,0:44:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天无绝人之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing that cannot be undone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.00,0:44:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好男人 Crixus\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a good man, crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.60,0:44:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明不会忍心让你受此磨难\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods will not see you treated so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.96,0:44:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今 他们青睐斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They now favor spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.43,0:44:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我不屑一顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}They give no shit for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.76,0:45:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 战神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, champion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.80,0:46:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了救一个你所憎恶的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd kill a fellow gaul…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.06,0:46:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你宁可杀死一个高卢人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save a man you hate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.26,0:46:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救的不是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not save spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.80,0:46:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救的是 一位铭刻着相同印记的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved a brother who shares the mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.06,0:46:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赚到了一个光荣的死法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have earned a glorious death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.23,0:46:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将死在角斗士的手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will die at the hands of a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.73,0:46:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈才离开这里一小会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave these walls for a fucking moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.80,0:46:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有一个新兵蛋子企图杀死斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a recruit tries to kill spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.66,0:46:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia自己的操蛋手下？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia's own fucking man?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.70,0:46:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是有Crixus 说不定他真成功了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he would have succeeded, if it weren't for crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.80,0:46:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的荣耀还未逝去\N{\fnArial\fs30}His days not passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.80,0:47:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.90,0:47:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉Vibius\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send note to vibius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.96,0:47:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus不卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus is no longer for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.30,0:47:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 恐怕协议已经敲定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I feared termsere already agreed upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.43,0:47:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的协议！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well fuck the terms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.23,0:47:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有意见 叫他来和我的老二理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should he have issue, he can reason to my cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.10,0:47:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 蛇蝎毒妇来了 还挺人模人样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh, the snake arrives, walking as if human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.80,0:47:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我没有错过测试吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray I have not missed the test?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.20,0:47:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于某些极为不幸的事情 测试已经推迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delayed, due to most unfortunate events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.90,0:47:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 卡普亚战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, the champion of capua, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.86,0:47:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在洗澡的时候 被人出其不意地偷袭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was attacked unawares in the baths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.13,0:47:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷袭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attacked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.10,0:47:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的新人 Segovax干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}By your recruit, segovax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.10,0:47:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How unfortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.30,0:47:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你的奴隶不幸 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your man, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.36,0:47:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得接受惩罚 必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had to be punished, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.03,0:48:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus yet lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.73,0:48:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.76,0:48:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人 不肯坦白原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man would not speak as to his reason, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.63,0:48:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便是阉了他老二 也不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when parted from his cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.93,0:48:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚你召见他的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave you no sign of cause{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.50,0:48:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并未露出任何马脚 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you met with him last night did he?{\r}
